<title>SPAIN: Spain's May trade deficit 205.6 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's May trade deficit 205.6 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The customs department of the Economy Ministry gave the following figures (billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE		MAY 97	APR 97	 MAY 96</p>
<p> Exports		     1,298.6	1,357.1     1,164.1</p>
<p> Imports		     1,504.1	1,635.8     1.433.4</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	    -205.6	-278.7	 -269.3</p>
<p> Def/surplus yr to date   -955.6	-749.9     -1,119.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are customs-cleared data.</p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE (EU)	 MAY 97	APR 97	MAY 96</p>
<p> Exports			 936.9	972.2	  851.0</p>
<p> Imports			 994.3    1,068.9	  946.5</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	     -57.3	-96.7	  -95.5</p>
<p> Def/surplus yr to date   -257.0	-199.6	 -309.7</p>
</text>
